/* Localizable.strings — keys are the English strings, mirroring Java n(zh, en). */

"A version index only records the file list, package versions and checksums. It holds no system files and does not mean the device was updated. The old index must match what the device runs now." = "版本索引只记录文件清单、软件包版本和校验值，不含系统文件，也不代表设备已更新。旧索引必须与设备当前运行的版本一致。";
"Added / removed" = "新增 / 删除";
"After a successful analysis, the new release's version index (.owrt-index.json) is saved in the app. Next time, tap Saved version indexes to use it as the old release, export it for the desktop app, or delete it." = "分析成功后，新固件的版本索引（.owrt-index.json）会保存在本应用中。下次可在「已保存的版本索引」中将其用作旧固件、导出给桌面版使用，或删除。";
"Analyze changes" = "分析差异";
"Analyze the old and new release first" = "请先分析旧固件和新固件";
"Analyzing an E5 release temporarily extracts the root filesystem image; keep enough free storage (usually several hundred MB or more)." = "分析 E5 固件时会临时解压根文件系统镜像，请预留足够存储空间（通常几百 MB 或更多）。";
"Apply reviewed patch" = "应用已审核的补丁";
"Automatically reboot after updating" = "更新完成后自动重启";
"Back" = "返回";
"Cancel" = "取消";
"Changed files" = "变化的文件";
"Check device status" = "查看设备状态";
"Close" = "关闭";
"Compare two full OpenWrt releases, build a patch with only the changed files, and update the device directly over SSH. Settings, extra packages and user data are kept." = "对比两个完整 OpenWrt 固件，只打包变化的文件生成补丁，并通过 SSH 直接更新设备。设置、额外软件包和用户数据都会保留。";
"Confirm reboot" = "确认重启";
"Connect and review" = "连接并审核";
"Connect the phone to the device's Wi-Fi or USB tethering and select the .ota patch on Update device. You can also open an .ota with this app from a file manager." = "将手机连到设备的 Wi-Fi 或 USB 共享网络，在「更新设备」中选择 .ota 补丁。也可以在文件管理器中用本应用打开 .ota 文件。";
"Connection interrupted. The device continues processing; check status again later." = "连接中断，设备会继续处理；稍后重新查看状态。";
"Create patch" = "制作补丁";
"Delete" = "删除";
"Delete this version index?" = "删除这个版本索引？";
"Device is writing. Closing this app does not cancel its transaction." = "设备正在写入，关闭本应用不会取消设备上的事务。";
"Device management address" = "设备管理地址";
"Device status loaded. Current version: %@" = "设备状态已加载，当前版本：%@";
"Enter the management address (E5 192.168.9.1, MU300 192.168.77.1 by default; host:port also works) and the root password." = "输入管理地址（E5 默认 192.168.9.1，MU300 默认 192.168.77.1，也支持 host:port 形式）和 root 密码。";
"Export" = "导出";
"Export .ota only" = "仅导出 .ota";
"Export patch" = "导出补丁";
"Export version index" = "导出版本索引";
"Exported patches use the desktop format and can also be applied with the desktop updater or in the device web UI (System > System patches)." = "导出的补丁使用桌面版格式，也可用桌面更新器或在设备网页后台（系统 > 系统补丁）中应用。";
"GitHub" = "GitHub";
"How to use" = "使用方法";
"If the device Wi-Fi reports no internet, stay connected; the app automatically uses the network that reaches the device." = "如果设备 Wi-Fi 提示无互联网，请保持连接；应用会自动使用能连通设备的网络。";
"If the save dialog shortens the file name, just save; the full name and extension are restored after export." = "如果保存对话框截短了文件名，直接保存即可；导出后会恢复完整文件名和扩展名。";
"Import a trusted patch and connect to a running OpenWrt device. Review before applying." = "导入可信的补丁，连接正在运行的 OpenWrt 设备，审核后再应用。";
"Important notes" = "注意事项";
"Includes kernel/boot update and matching module changes. User packages, settings and data are retained." = "包含内核 / 启动区更新及相应的模块变化。用户软件包、设置和数据都会保留。";
"Keep the device powered during the update and do not unplug or reboot it. The phone may lock or switch apps; the device finishes on its own." = "更新期间保持设备通电，不要拔电或重启。手机可以锁屏或切换应用，设备会自行完成。";
"Keep your data · Update changed files" = "保留你的数据 · 只更新变化的文件";
"Licences: app code MIT; ext4 parser AGPL-3.0-or-later; third-party notices in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md." = "许可证：应用代码 MIT；ext4 解析器 AGPL-3.0-or-later；第三方声明见 THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md。";
"Links" = "链接";
"Lino Notes" = "Lino Notes";
"Local file or dependency conflicts; nothing written: %@" = "存在本地文件或依赖冲突，未写入任何内容：%@";
"New full release" = "新完整固件";
"New version index saved" = "新版本索引已保存";
"No saved indexes yet. After a successful analysis the new release's index is saved here." = "暂无已保存的索引。分析成功后，新固件的索引会保存在这里。";
"Old full release or version index" = "旧完整固件或版本索引";
"On Create patch, select the old release (the version the device runs now) and the new full release ZIP. A saved version index can replace the old full ZIP. E5 and MU300 / F50 / V50 / U30Air are supported." = "在「制作补丁」中选择旧固件（设备当前运行的版本）和新的完整固件 ZIP。已保存的版本索引可代替旧完整 ZIP。支持 E5 和 MU300 / F50 / V50 / U30Air。";
"Only import and apply patches from trusted sources. Patches write system files as root." = "只导入并应用可信来源的补丁。补丁会以 root 身份写入系统文件。";
"Patch saved: %@" = "补丁已保存：%@";
"Preparing the update…" = "正在准备更新…";
"Preparing update files…" = "正在准备更新文件…";
"Processing…" = "处理中…";
"Progress is shown automatically; you can also tap Check device status at any time. Reboot the device when prompted." = "进度会自动显示；也可以随时点「查看设备状态」。提示时请重启设备。";
"Reboot device" = "重启设备";
"Reboot device?" = "重启设备？";
"Reboot requested. The device is restarting." = "已请求重启，设备正在重启。";
"Required / available: %@ / %@" = "需要 / 可用：%@ / %@";
"Review and continue" = "审核并继续";
"Rollback complete. Reboot the device here." = "已回滚。请在此重启设备。";
"Saved version indexes" = "已保存的版本索引";
"Select .ota patch" = "选择 .ota 补丁";
"Select ZIP file" = "选择 ZIP 文件";
"Select ZIP or version index JSON" = "选择 ZIP 或版本索引 JSON";
"Select an .ota patch." = "请选择 .ota 补丁。";
"Select an old ZIP or version index JSON." = "请选择旧 ZIP 或版本索引 JSON。";
"Select files to review versions and compatibility here." = "请先选择文件，在此查看版本与兼容性。";
"Select patch and device" = "选择补丁与设备";
"Select releases" = "选择固件";
"Settings, extra packages and user data are retained. Recovery copies precede writes. Kernel and modules can update together. Import trusted patches only." = "设置、额外软件包和用户数据都会保留。写入前会先做恢复备份。内核和模块可一同更新。只导入可信的补丁。";
"Started; waiting for the device…" = "已开始，等待设备…";
"System files are updated, but web plugin reload failed: %@" = "系统文件已更新，但网页插件重载失败：%@";
"Tap Analyze to review the target device, version change, changed files and payload size. Blocking reasons are listed if a patch cannot be made." = "点「分析差异」查看目标设备、版本变化、变化文件和负载大小。如果无法制作补丁，会列出阻止原因。";
"Tap Connect and review. When space, local changes, dependencies and version all pass, tap Apply reviewed patch. Optionally enable automatic reboot." = "点「连接并审核」。空间、本地修改、依赖和版本都通过后，点「应用已审核的补丁」。可选择更新后自动重启。";
"Tap Export patch to save the complete update ZIP (update.ota, desktop updater and README), or Export .ota only." = "点「导出补丁」保存完整更新 ZIP（update.ota、桌面更新器和 README），或点「仅导出 .ota」。";
"Target profile" = "目标机型";
"Technical details" = "技术详情";
"The device identity is verified between review and apply; review again after switching or resetting the device." = "审核和应用之间会验证设备身份；更换或重置设备后请重新审核。";
"The device keeps recovery copies before writing and rolls back on failure; still back up important settings in the device web UI first." = "设备写入前会保留恢复备份，失败时自动回滚；仍建议先在设备网页后台备份重要设置。";
"The new release must be a full ZIP." = "新固件必须是完整 ZIP。";
"The old release must match what the device runs now. Do not force an update when the review fails." = "旧固件必须与设备当前运行的版本一致。审核未通过时不要强制更新。";
"The update is complete. Rebooting briefly disconnects networking; settings and data are retained." = "更新已完成。重启会短暂断开网络；设置和数据都会保留。";
"This location does not allow renaming; change the file extension to %@ in your file manager." = "该位置不允许重命名；请在文件管理器中将扩展名改为 %@。";
"This location does not allow renaming; change the file extension to .json in your file manager." = "该位置不允许重命名；请在文件管理器中将扩展名改为 .json。";
"Two releases. One compact update." = "两个固件，一个紧凑的更新。";
"Uncompressed payload" = "未压缩负载";
"Update complete. Reboot the device here to activate the update." = "更新完成。请在此重启设备以激活更新。";
"Update complete. The device is rebooting. Check its status again shortly." = "更新完成，设备正在重启，稍后请重新查看状态。";
"Update completed, but reboot failed. Retry below: %@" = "更新已完成，但重启失败。请在下方重试：%@";
