"Update the system. Keep your setup." = "更新系统，保留你的设置。";
"Updating the system…" = "正在更新系统…";
"Use an old full ZIP or saved version index, and a new full ZIP. A new index is saved after analysis." = "使用旧完整 ZIP 或已保存的版本索引，以及新完整 ZIP。分析后会保存新的索引。";
"Use as old release" = "用作旧固件";
"Use it as the old input next time. Saving an index does not mean the device was updated." = "下次可将其用作旧固件输入。保存索引不代表设备已更新。";
"Version index exported: %@" = "版本索引已导出：%@";
"View file list" = "查看文件列表";
"iOS version %@" = "iOS 版 %@";
